WEBVTT

00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:30.795
Feeling as though something terrible
would happen to me

00:01:30.837 --> 00:01:32.255
or to my family.

00:01:34.006 --> 00:01:36.968
We worried about our friends
and family back home.

00:01:37.009 --> 00:01:41.264
My grandmother was still in Kabul,
and I missed her terribly.

00:01:41.889 --> 00:01:45.726
I'd go to bed at night
and say the prayers she taught me

00:01:45.768 --> 00:01:47.812
to pray for her safety.

00:01:48.604 --> 00:01:51.983
We wanted nothing more
than to go back home.

00:01:52.316 --> 00:01:56.445
But when the Taliban took over
the country in 1996,

00:01:56.487 --> 00:02:00.533
my parents realized
that was no longer an option.